WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.764
"I'm bored," Sid said.

2
00:00:11.765 --> 00:00:18.465
Sara nodded. "There's nothing to do."

3
00:00:18.466 --> 00:00:22.346
Tor found a ball in her bag.

4
00:00:22.347 --> 00:00:26.519
"Let's play catch," she said.

5
00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:31.475
"That sounds fun," Rex said.

6
00:00:31.476 --> 00:00:35.784
Just then a rat ran by.

7
00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:38.645
It slipped under a leaf.

8
00:00:38.646 --> 00:00:41.442
"Look!" Sara said.

9
00:00:41.443 --> 00:00:44.851
A hole was beneath the leaf.

10
00:00:44.852 --> 00:00:47.707
The rat dived in.

11
00:00:47.708 --> 00:00:51.954
Sara peeked into the hole.

12
00:00:51.955 --> 00:00:53.990
The rat got mad.

13
00:00:53.991 --> 00:00:56.299
Squeak! Squeak!

14
00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:58.900
Sara jumped back.

15
00:00:58.901 --> 00:01:02.256
"The rat lives in there," Rex said.

16
00:01:02.257 --> 00:01:06.001
"Its home is like a tiny fort."

17
00:01:06.002 --> 00:01:07.994
Sara smiled.

18
00:01:07.995 --> 00:01:12.177
"Let's build our own fort!" she said.

19
00:01:12.178 --> 00:01:20.381
"That will be fun!" Sid said.

20
00:01:20.382 --> 00:01:26.289
Rex and Tor got some big sticks.

21
00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:36.730
Sara and Sid worked on the fort.

22
00:01:36.731 --> 00:01:42.270
"We need more sticks!" Sara said.

23
00:01:42.271 --> 00:01:49.209
Rex carried lots of sticks.

24
00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:52.837
"Wow," Sara said.

25
00:01:52.838 --> 00:01:56.377
"You're strong, Rex!"

26
00:01:56.378 --> 00:02:05.305
Rex grinned. Roar!

27
00:02:05.306 --> 00:02:11.775
Crash! The fort fell over.

